# Town talk in the capitals (Camelot, Jordheim, Tir na Nog): trainers, merchants, the bank, crafting.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---------------- Any capital ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic capital
@who *
@needs in_capital
{capital} is busy tonight
trainer at last, three levels of points to spend
selling off a whole bag of loot, the merchants love me
spent ten minutes looking for the bank again
repairs cost more than the loot was worth
need to train and sell, then straight back out
i love town breaks, nothing here tries to eat me
people shouting wares everywhere, cant hear myself think
picked up new spells at the trainer, cant wait to try them
spent all my coin on spells, worth it
the guards here never smile
the dye merchant has new colors, or i never noticed them before
so many crafters at the forge it sounds like a battle
dropped half my bags at the bank, feels like a new character
trying out a new spec, wish me luck
@invites ask_anyone
anyone near the forge?
anyone selling cheap armor around {level}?
anyone want to group from here? i am {level}
@invites ask_where
where is the armor merchant in here?
@invites ask_advice
how much do merchants pay for {item}?
@invites ask_opinion
bind here or out near the camp, what do you think?
@who Crafter
@invites chat
back at the forge, my favorite part of the day
@who Leveler
@invites complaint
every minute in town is a minute not leveling

